# Line endings are a repository fact, not a per-checkout accident.
#
# Without this file, `core.autocrlf` decided what a checkout looked like, and a
# test that compared source text against a literal containing `\n` passed on one
# machine and failed on another (`workspace-ownership-smoke` did exactly that).
# Normalising the index to LF and checking out LF everywhere removes the class.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never rewritten, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
